WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.350
Too tired to plan today's lifts?

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.766
Tap Build, then Build My Workout. Tell it your energy, what is sore, and your time.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:17.305
It builds the session in blocks. Sore muscles are avoided. You see the sets and the time up front.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:22.272
Want it lighter? Heavier? Dial any block, and the sets and time update.

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:29.745
Then train one set at a time. Need ninety-one kilos? The plates are worked out for you. No program needed.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.219
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
